        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{\n{\n  \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": `Analyze this email and return ONLY valid JSON.\n\nEmail:\nFrom: ${$json.headers?.from || \"\"}\nSubject: ${$json.headers?.subject || \"\"}\nBody: ${$json.text || \"\"}\n\nToday's date is: ${$now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd')}\nCurrent time is: ${$now.toFormat('HH:mm')} IST\n\nRules:\n\n- category must be EXACTLY one of:\n[\"work\",\"finance\",\"personal\",\"promotion\",\"meeting\",\"spam\",\"urgent\"]\n\n- priority must be EXACTLY one of:\n[\"Low\",\"Medium\",\"High\"]\n\n- needs_reply must be true or false\n\n- meeting_detected must be true or false\n\n- confidence must be an integer between 0 and 100\n\n- If a meeting is detected, extract meeting details with these STRICT rules:\n\n* meeting_date: MUST be the EXACT date mentioned in the email in format YYYY-MM-DD.\n* meeting_time: MUST be the EXACT start time mentioned in the email in 24-hour HH:MM format.\n* meeting_end_time: MUST be the EXACT end time mentioned in the email in 24-hour HH:MM format.\n* If no end time exists, add 1 hour to the start time.\n* meeting_title: short descriptive title.\n\n- Use today's date ONLY to resolve relative dates such as:\n\"tomorrow\", \"next Monday\", \"this Friday\".\n\n- If an explicit date exists, ALWAYS use it.\n\n- All times in the email are IST.\n- Do NOT convert timezones.\n- Do NOT invent dates or times.\n- If meeting details are incomplete, set meeting_detected=false.\n\nCategory examples:\n\nJob alerts, newsletters, internship campaigns, marketing emails → promotion\nCalendar invites, interview schedules, meetings → meeting\nBank alerts, invoices, payments → finance\nScams, phishing, suspicious emails → spam\nCollege work, assignments, project discussions → work\nPersonal conversations → personal\nAnything requiring immediate action → urgent\n\nReturn ONLY raw JSON.\n\n{\n  \"summary\":\"\",\n  \"category\":\"\",\n  \"priority\":\"\",\n  \"needs_reply\":false,\n  \"meeting_detected\":false,\n  \"meeting_title\":\"\",\n  \"meeting_date\":\"\",\n  \"meeting_time\":\"\",\n  \"meeting_end_time\":\"\",\n  \"confidence\":95\n}\n\nIf no meeting exists, leave meeting_title, meeting_date, meeting_time and meeting_end_time as empty strings.`\n    }\n  ],\n  \"temperature\": 0.1\n}\n}}",
        "options": {}
      },
